00:02:47.501 --> 00:02:53.173 size:53% position:73% line:53%
que je dois réparer, j'y vais

00:02:48.535 --> 00:02:54.208 size:53% position:73% line:53%
au rythme que je veux.

00:02:52.472 --> 00:02:55.242 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Votre matière première,

00:02:53.473 --> 00:02:56.276 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ce sont des souliers que

00:02:54.508 --> 00:03:00.447 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des gens laissent dans des

00:02:55.542 --> 00:03:01.448 size:53% position:73% line:53%
magasins quand ils s'achètent

00:02:56.577 --> 00:03:02.482 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de nouveaux souliers.

00:03:00.747 --> 00:03:03.517 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Exactement.

00:03:01.748 --> 00:03:06.286 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Et vous, souvent,

00:03:02.783 --> 00:03:07.287 size:53% position:73% line:53%
vous arrivez à en refaire

00:03:03.817 --> 00:03:08.322 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des souliers corrects.

00:03:06.587 --> 00:03:09.356 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Absolument. Complètement

00:03:07.588 --> 00:03:10.390 size:53% position:73% line:53%
corrects. Et d'ailleurs,

00:03:08.622 --> 00:03:11.425 size:53% position:73% line:53%
je dis souvent : ça ne prend pas

00:03:09.656 --> 00:03:12.426 size:53% position:73% line:53%
grand-chose.

00:03:10.691 --> 00:03:13.460 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ah oui?

00:03:11.725 --> 00:03:14.494 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Oui, oui. Il y a des questions

00:03:12.726 --> 00:03:15.529 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de mode, qui vont peut-être

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:20.267 size:53% position:73% line:53%
justifier l'abandon d'une paire

00:03:14.795 --> 00:03:21.268 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de chaussures. Il y a aussi

00:03:15.829 --> 00:03:22.302 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le fait que... Vous savez,

00:03:20.567 --> 00:03:23.303 size:53% position:73% line:53%
vous connaissez peut-être

00:03:21.568 --> 00:03:24.338 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la blague qui veut que quelqu'un

00:03:22.603 --> 00:03:25.372 size:53% position:73% line:53%
change de voiture quand

00:03:23.604 --> 00:03:26.373 size:53% position:73% line:53%
