00:03:47.127 --> 00:03:49.896 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Absolument.

00:03:48.161 --> 00:03:50.931 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ressemeler...

00:03:49.196 --> 00:03:51.965 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ressemeler, changer

00:03:50.197 --> 00:03:55.168 size:53% position:73% line:53%
