00:04:06.246 --> 00:04:08.448 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Wow!

00:04:06.647 --> 00:04:09.483 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ah oui, oui.

00:04:07.681 --> 00:04:10.484 size:53% position:73% line:53%
C'est beaucoup, hein.

00:04:08.749 --> 00:04:11.518 size:53% position:73% line:53%
