00:04:16.323 --> 00:04:19.126 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Puis est-ce que vous croisez

00:04:17.324 --> 00:04:20.160 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des gens dans la rue qui portent

00:04:18.392 --> 00:04:21.161 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les souliers que vous avez

00:04:19.426 --> 00:04:24.064 size:53% position:73% line:53%
réparés, des fois?

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:27.067 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Ça vous arrive, des fois?

00:04:21.461 --> 00:04:28.068 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Bof...

00:04:26.967 --> 00:04:30.937 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(rire)

00:04:27.367 --> 00:04:31.938 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Probablement. Mais, je suis

00:04:28.368 --> 00:04:32.973 size:53% position:73% line:53%
